{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLACE ON PATHS BUILD ON SIDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only place your units on paths and build on sides so your units confronts with enemy directly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIT LEVELS AND ITEMS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarfs level up automatically by living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some abilities can be unlocked with star levels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE BUILDINGS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to build barracks &amp; builders to increase max amounts of troops you can have.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build lumberjacks and stonecutters to gain materials!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ITEMS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are able items to your units, items can be dropped from chests or can be bought from the shop, they have qualities so if your luck stat is high you get better ones.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ARMY</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your cards to play before the game. Some units have synergies with others.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GETTING HELP FROM DIFFERENT RACES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair watchtower so you can call others to fight with you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can place Elves or Granhars after you repair the watchtower but you can only choose one of them.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>INCREASE YOUR STATS BY BUYING TOWERS\u00a0</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can increase your stats by buying &amp; upgrading towers, towers are more like a 'supporters' in this game.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHESTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open chests and upgrade your units.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GRID BASED</strong>\u00a0<strong>PLACEMENT</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are able to place dwarfs and towers to the grids.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526560?t=1773231188","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3526560?t=1773231188","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/56129dcd4a830b495dd504f196e2d5a6ada4292b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773231188","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3526560/56129dcd4a830b495dd504f196e2d5a6ada4292b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773231188","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLACE ON PATHS BUILD ON SIDES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only place your units on paths and build on sides so your units confronts with enemy directly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNIT LEVELS AND ITEMS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dwarfs level up automatically by living.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some abilities can be unlocked with star levels.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE BUILDINGS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p c